    { cat: 'meta', icon: 'bug_report',          label: 'Prompt Debugger',        text: 'Debug the following prompt. Identify why it may not be producing the intended output.\\n\\nPrompt to debug:\\n[paste prompt here]\\n\\nExpected output: [what you wanted the AI to produce]\\nActual output: [what the AI actually produced]\\n\\nDiagnosis:\\n1. Ambiguity: [any unclear instructions?]\\n2. Missing context: [what did the AI not know?]\\n3. Format mismatch: [was the output format unspecified?]\\n4. Conflicting instructions: [do any parts contradict each other?]\\n5. Scope creep: [did the prompt invite too much or too little?]\\n\\nFixed prompt: [corrected version]' },
