    { cat: 'usecases', icon: 'bug_report',      label: 'Bug Report Template',    text: 'File a complete bug report for the following issue:\\n\\nTitle: [[short_description]]\\n\\nEnvironment:\\n- OS: [[os]]\\n- Browser/App version: [[version]]\\n- User account type: [[account_type]]\\n\\nSteps to reproduce:\\n1. [step]\\n2. [step]\\n3. [step]\\n\\nExpected behaviour: [[expected]]\\nActual behaviour: [[actual]]\\nFrequency: [[always / sometimes / once]]\\nSeverity: [[critical / high / medium / low]]\\nScreenshots/logs: [[attached / not available]]' },
