    { cat: 'usecases', icon: 'summarize',       label: 'Report Builder',         text: 'Build a report on the following topic.\\n\\nTopic: [[topic]]\\nAudience: [[audience]]\\nData/sources available: [[sources]]\\n\\nReport structure:\\n1. Executive summary (5 bullets)\\n2. Key findings (ranked by impact)\\n3. Analysis (what the data means)\\n4. Recommendations (actionable, numbered)\\n5. Appendix (methodology, data sources)\\n\\nLength: [[length]]\\nTone: [[tone — formal / analytical / accessible]]' },
    { cat: 'usecases', icon: 'trending_up',     label: 'Market Research Brief',  text: 'Produce a market research brief for [[market_or_product]].\\n\\nBusiness question: [[question]]\\nTimeframe: [[timeframe]]\\nBudget: [[budget]]\\n\\nResearch plan:\\n1. Research objectives (3-5 specific questions to answer)\\n2. Methodology (primary vs secondary research)\\n3. Target respondents (who to survey/interview)\\n4. Data sources to use\\n5. Deliverables\\n6. Timeline\\n7. Success criteria' },
    { cat: 'usecases', icon: 'compare',         label: 'Competitive Analysis',   text: 'Run a competitive analysis for [[product]] against [[competitors]].\\n\\nAnalysis dimensions:\\n1. Product features (comparison table)\\n2. Pricing model\\n3. Target customer\\n4. Go-to-market approach\\n5. Strengths (what each competitor does best)\\n6. Weaknesses (where they fall short)\\n7. Our differentiation opportunity\\n\\nOutput: full comparison table + one-paragraph positioning recommendation' },
    { cat: 'usecases', icon: 'record_voice_over', label: 'Customer Interview',   text: 'Prepare and run a customer interview for [[research_goal]].\\n\\nCustomer profile: [[profile]]\\nKey questions to answer: [[questions]]\\n\\nInterview guide:\\n- Warm-up (5 min): [questions to build rapport]\\n- Core exploration (20 min): [5-7 deep questions]\\n- Problem deep-dive (10 min): [follow-up probes]\\n- Wrap-up (5 min): [synthesis + permission to follow up]\\n\\nNote-taking template:\\nKey quotes:\\nSurprises:\\nPatterns to explore:' },
    { cat: 'usecases', icon: 'checklist',       label: 'Survey Designer',        text: 'Design a survey for [[survey_goal]].\\n\\nTarget respondents: [[respondents]]\\nExpected completion time: [[time]] minutes\\nDelivery method: [[email / in-app / phone]]\\n\\nSurvey sections:\\n1. Screener (2 questions)\\n2. Background (2-3 questions)\\n3. Core topic (5-7 questions)\\n4. Rating scales (NPS / CSAT / custom)\\n5. Open-ended qualitative (1-2 questions)\\n\\nFor each question: text + format + why it is included' },
    { cat: 'usecases', icon: 'workspace_premium', label: 'Case Study Builder',   text: 'Write a case study for the following success story.\\n\\nCustomer: [[customer]]\\nIndustry: [[industry]]\\nChallenge: [[challenge]]\\nSolution: [[solution_provided]]\\nResult: [[measurable_result]]\\nTimeline: [[timeframe]]\\nQuote approved: [[quote]]\\n\\nStructure: headline → challenge section → solution section → results section → customer quote → about section\\nLength: [[length]] words\\nUse: [[website / sales deck / press]]' },
    { cat: 'usecases', icon: 'local_library',   label: 'White Paper',            text: 'Outline a white paper on: [[topic]]\\n\\nTarget reader: [[reader_title]] at [[company_type]]\\nCore argument: [[argument]]\\nData available: [[data]]\\n\\nWhite paper structure:\\n1. Executive summary\\n2. Industry context and problem\\n3. Why existing solutions fall short\\n4. Our perspective / framework\\n5. Evidence and case examples\\n6. Recommendations\\n7. Conclusion\\n\\nTone: authoritative, evidence-based\\nLength: [[N]] pages\\nCall to action: [[cta]]' },
    { cat: 'usecases', icon: 'handshake',       label: 'Partnership Proposal',   text: 'Write a partnership proposal from [[our_company]] to [[partner_company]].\\n\\nPartnership type: [[type — co-marketing / integration / referral / JV]]\\nMutual benefit: [[what both parties gain]]\\nAsk: [[what we want from them]]\\nOffer: [[what we bring to the table]]\\n\\nStructure:\\n1. Why this partnership makes sense (strategic fit)\\n2. What we propose (specific terms)\\n3. What we each bring\\n4. Success metrics\\n5. Proposed next steps\\n\\nTone: direct, collegial, mutually focused' },
    { cat: 'usecases', icon: 'meeting_room',    label: 'Meeting Agenda',         text: 'Create a meeting agenda for: [[meeting_title]]\\n\\nDate/time: [[datetime]]\\nAttendees: [[attendees]]\\nMeeting goal: [[goal]]\\nDuration: [[duration]] minutes\\n\\nAgenda:\\n[Time] Welcome + objective (5 min)\\n[Time] [[agenda_item_1]] — Owner: [[owner]] (N min)\\n[Time] [[agenda_item_2]] — Owner: [[owner]] (N min)\\n[Time] [[agenda_item_3]] — Owner: [[owner]] (N min)\\n[Time] Decisions needed (10 min)\\n[Time] Next steps + owners (5 min)\\n\\nPre-read materials: [[prereads]]' },
