    { badge: "Hero's Journey", name: "Hero's Journey Narrative Arc", desc: 'Classic storytelling structure',
      text: "Ordinary World: [the hero's normal life before the adventure]\\nCall to Adventure: [the problem or opportunity that disrupts it]\\nRefusal of the Call: [initial resistance or hesitation]\\nMeeting the Mentor: [the guide who gives advice, tools, or courage]\\nCrossing the Threshold: [committing to the journey]\\nTests, Allies, Enemies: [the challenges faced along the way]\\nThe Ordeal: [the darkest moment — the biggest test]\\nThe Reward: [what is gained from surviving the ordeal]\\nThe Road Back: [the return, with a new challenge]\\nResurrection: [the final test — proving the transformation]\\nReturn with the Elixir: [bringing the gift back to the ordinary world]" },
